SUMMARY:Mars Hill First Fridays
DESCRIPTION:First Fridays 5-8pm Mars Hill NC April thru December Music • Art • Food • Gifts • Prizes \n\n\n\n\nJuly 3rd Town of Mars Hill\, NC First Friday will have plenty of Music and Dance!\n\n\nIt’ll be Day 3 of the BMIFF USA festival on Mars Hill University College St featuring:\nFolklore Slavey ensemble from Bulgaria\nZespół Pieśni i Tańca Podlasie from Poland\nRéalta School of Irish Dance from S Carolina\nThe Midnight Still from Raleigh NC\nJubilee American Dance Theatre from California\n& of course our own world famous Bailey Mountain Cloggers\, accompanied by the Hidden Valley Ranchers from Black Mtn NC\n\n\n+\nFrances Eliza at Mars Landing Arts Center\nTina & Her Pony at Camden’s Coffee House\nMr Lot at Mars Theatre Brewing Company
