SUMMARY:The Saylor Brothers  | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:Jamgrass innovators from Asheville!!! \nSaylor Brothers\, a fixture of the Asheville bluegrass/jamgrass scene\, return to the outdoor stage at Wedge Brewing on Friday July 3. Phillip Barker (Town Mountain) joins on mandolino. \nWhat a great way to begin the holiday weekend!!\nFree for everyone and everyone welcome. \nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/brushfire-stankgrass-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Screenshot-2026-06-30-164931-e1782852608678.png
END:VEVENT
